Z||000008||Formula||08-28-2001||03:34 PM||||from what I can tell..... this car kicks my fieros a$$ in relibility and gas mileage.<P>I'm sure you guys dont like it when you tell someone you have a fiero and they start ripping on it.  The only comments I get about the neon are about the headgaskets and that its not a sports car.... I'm pretty sure that the neon sohc is faster then the iron duke fiero (lighter more power) and has more and cheaper mods out there for it then any fiero ($2000 turbo kits! $600 body kits! $300 exhausts! $200 headers!..... look at the prices for the fiero.. $4000 supercharger, or you can build a $3000 stroker like mine for 200+ hp, body kits are outrageous $600 or a nose alone, $800 for good headers, $500 for good exhaust)<P>I know neons arent the coolest or the best cars around but I think that its about equal with the fiero when you balance out the differences.  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigformulagt.jpg"> ||||reg||1
