Z||000015||firstfiero||08-28-2001||11:25 PM||||    Jesus dude...don't get so offended. Were just haveing some fun with ya.<BR>   1) neon isn't a good deal for a comuter....read consumer reports and you'll find out how bad a car they are.<BR>   2)Can't think of a single good reason to g one out.<BR>   It doesn't have to be an american car for me to buy it...other then trucks I hate most american cars. <BR>   Trucks....I buy american. Have a brand new sport trak and I love it. very versitile car.<BR>   commuter car....I'm buying jap. probobly a honda LISA...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> because thats what they do best! solid reliable commuter cars that you can put a couple 100 grand on the odometer without any problems.<BR>    sedans...of course I'm going german! bmw all the way! <BR>     <BR>   The cars I would avoid buying without a damn good warranty is jeep...currently the worst all around vehicle being sold in this country. Or dodge...the 2nd worst. This is based on what I read about the sever amount of problems during and after the warranty period.<BR>    The are just my humble oppions dude and when comes right down to it other then to me ....mean nothing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||6
