Z||000050||Formula||08-31-2001||08:06 AM||||heres the deal.... it looks like this one had intake and exhaust done to it.  (big chrome hings on these cars lol.  The neon off the line is PITIFUL.  It feels slower then the stroker (when the stroker is idling off the line at 600 rpms), BUT when it starts pulling towards 5 or 6k rpm, its fairly quick.  The thing is that most people would never even see the powerband of the neon because its so high in the gear its almost scary to take it up there.  I cruised in it last night around campus and did it turn heads.... YEP, it actually was getting double takes, did it turn as many heads as the fiero rumbling around, Not even close!  The Fiero is faster and more of a head turner, but it sucks driving it to school everyday with the modded engine.  The neon is actually not quite as roomy as the fiero but I think the 4 door model makes it a lot more comfy then the 2 door.  <P>And everyone know.....new toys are always fun at first!!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigformulagt.jpg"> ||||reg||1
